1
00:00:00,028 --> 00:00:00,946
You're a barn owl,

2
00:00:00,966 --> 00:00:01,646
and your marriage

3
00:00:01,666 --> 00:00:02,716
is falling apart.

4
00:00:02,736 --> 00:00:03,178
This year,

5
00:00:03,198 --> 00:00:03,953
your nest raised

6
00:00:03,973 --> 00:00:05,249
almost no chicks.

7
00:00:05,269 --> 00:00:05,737
So one of you

8
00:00:05,757 --> 00:00:06,950
decides to leave.

9
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:07,550
In a long

10
00:00:07,570 --> 00:00:08,263
Swiss study,

11
00:00:08,283 --> 00:00:09,138
about one in four

12
00:00:09,158 --> 00:00:10,313
couples split up,

13
00:00:10,333 --> 00:00:11,563
almost always after a

14
00:00:11,583 --> 00:00:12,824
