15
00:00:12,844 --> 00:00:13,849
And the male usually

16
00:00:13,869 --> 00:00:14,866
keeps the house.

17
00:00:14,886 --> 00:00:15,653
After the split,

18
00:00:15,673 --> 00:00:16,503
at least one ex

19
00:00:16,523 --> 00:00:17,391
